    "body": "I figured it out.\r\n\r\n## The WSL VM cannot access GitHub\r\n\r\nThe machine this WSL is installed on is currently in a country that walls GitHub.\r\nThe machine itself uses proxy and therefore can access GitHub.\r\nThe WSL does not have the same proxy configuration and therefore cannot access GitHub.\r\n\r\n## Solution\r\n\r\nUse Windows to download the binary and move them into the bin in WSL manually.",
